    "note": "CPython 3.14.8 resolves the published Core 0.45.9 and requests 2.34.2, plus the complete developer group. Core 0.45.9 owns schema 9 and exposes public pinned artifact-name catalog reads. Core 0.46 introduces incompatible schema 10 and is excluded. Requests uses the existing 2.x bounds because the transport is verified on that API lane.",
